Reality: send X25519MLKEM768 instead of removing it.

Since XTLS/REALITY 8cdf7bf (2026-09-08, in Xray 26.9) the server rejects a
ClientHello without an X25519MLKEM768 key share before X25519, and sing-box
1.14.4 strips that share from every fingerprint, so no sing-box client gets
through. This keeps the share (Chrome 131+), adds it to fingerprints that
lack it (Safari, iOS, Firefox, Edge), and signs the session ID with the key
the server picks: the X25519 share, else the X25519 half of the hybrid one.
Applied by scripts/build-libbox.sh and android/scripts/build-libbox-android.sh.

